OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA window on to life-or-death
OL,7,     Fincidents in the fast-paced world
OL,8,     Fof the most specialised emergency
OL,9,     Ffirst responders. Joiner John (60)
OL,10,     Fsuddenly collapses from a cardiac
OL,11,     Farrest.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FPolice bring in an abusive male
OL,14,     Funder arrest who claims he has a
OL,15,     Fracing heart, and two friends
OL,16,     Farrive in resus who have
OL,17,     Fdislocated each other's shoulders
OL,18,     Fduring a friendly wrestle.
