OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Natalia evicts a lipoma from an
OL,7,     Festate agent and Dr Adil gets the
OL,8,     Fthumbs up for treating a nasty
OL,9,     Fwart. Meanwhile, Dr Magnus zaps
OL,10,     Fsome itchy growths on his
OL,11,     Fpatient's midriff.
OL,12,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,13,     FIn 2011, Julie Dixon murdered her
OL,14,     Ffiance David Twigg by locking him
OL,15,     Fin a cupboard and starting a fire,
OL,16,     Fbut told the police that it was
OL,17,     Fpart of a suicide pact.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/5
